            "releaseNotes": "In this release we made the following updates:\n \n\u2022 Added support for launching Cloud PC and Azure Virtual Desktop resources from the Windows App web portal.\n\u2022 Resolved an issue that caused the \"Refresh All Resources\" shortcut (Command + R) to sometimes fail after switching tabs.\n\u2022 Added mitigations to prevent stuck Windows keys in the remote session.\n\u2022 Resolved an issue where workspace refresh would get stuck when authentication or token acquisition fails.\n\u2022 Fixed multi-monitor layout and scaling when Retina support is enabled (including mixed-resolution displays).\n\u2022 Resolved issues with selection highlighting and keyboard focus in the account switcher.\n\u2022 Improved WebAuthn redirection by resolving passkey registration issues with external security keys.\n\u2022 Improved reconnection reliability and connection monitoring to help prevent premature session disconnections during network interruptions.\n \nIn addition, we've also made updates to strengthen security, performance and reliability, and to lay the groundwork for upcoming features.\n \nThis update requires macOS 15 and later. macOS 14 is no longer supported.\n \nIf you encounter any errors, you can contact us via Help > Submit Feedback.",
